# Optional: use the VS Code REST Client extension, or open these in a browser.
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/health

### Check the database separately
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/db-health

### Users (no credentials or contact details)
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/users

### Categories
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/vehicle-types

### All vehicles, with owner and category
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/vehicles

### E-bikes from the current sample dataset
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/vehicles?type_id=97ffdbc8-61ed-4092-a269-b8e2bb35c958
